{"id": "EUVD-2026-108299", "enisaUuid": "c0cacd44-9033-35f4-b98c-54a0cff4a47d", "description": "Incus 7.0.1 before 7.0.2 and 7.2.0 before 7.5.0 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability that allows project-restricted clients to copy volumes by omitting source.type. Attackers can send crafted POST requests to the custom volumes endpoint with a chosen source.project to copy and read other projects' volumes, snapshots, and configuration.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T19:13:45", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T19:13:45", "baseScore": 8.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:H/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/lxc/incus/security/advisories/GHSA-jh4v-j34r-2mgh", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/incus-7.0.1-before-7.0.2-and-7.2.0-before-7.5.0-project-restriction-bypass-via-custom-volume-copy"], "aliases": ["GHSA-c5q4-rxv3-w923", "CVE-2026-115376"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ed718a78-5980-3ba0-8b24-2709940ff6fb", "product": {"name": "incus", "vendor": {"name": "lxc"}}, "product_version": "7.2.0 <7.5.0"}, {"id": "f5019db6-4c0b-3722-92a5-1b71f9040076", "product": {"name": "incus", "vendor": {"name": "lxc"}}, "product_version": "7.0.1 <7.0.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "d86e12dd-35f2-33b3-a63e-22490971c8d3", "vendor": {"name": "lxc"}}], "isExploited": false}